{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20260OGyDkLP001795507458.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>財政司司長陳茂波展開英國訪問行程。</p><p></p><p>陳茂波率領代表團，當地周一與劍橋大學校長會面，介紹本港創科及北部都會區大學城發展，歡迎劍橋大學加強與本地大學及科研機構聯繫及研究合作。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.FS-1300_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026RPoik1GCtA1795507561.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>他之後出席由貿發局及劍橋合辦的圓桌會議，指香港具備由實驗室到上市的融資渠道，加上河套香港園區已啟用，能協助企業連接大灣區市場，歡迎當地機構及企業來港設研發基地並集資。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.FS-1300_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026vuNN4HlmRV1795507576.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>代表團下午與劍橋科研轉化機構交流，並參觀藥廠阿斯利康。陳茂波指英國獲批新藥在港註冊後，可經「港澳藥械通」在大灣區使用，歡迎在港擴展業務。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T09:04:03.175033+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":238,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T05:09:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T18:57:33.628512+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T08:57:17.921069+00:00","content_hash":"531aaf7f9a2cf9c30dbc7e5bdc2c3ee6e72d2e41a4f9c083f8b10ce9e4915d85","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T09:04:03.175033+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}